1
00:00:01,309 --> 00:00:03,329
[musika]

2
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:19,705
Afiafi fou i le fale kofe,

3
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:19,705
E fa'ata'ape'apeina fale i le puao mafiafia. [musika]

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,200
Ou te savalivali solo i pitonuu o loʻo i ai manatuaga

5
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:26,200
fa'avalea a'u.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,095
O fea i le tautotogo mafanafana

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,320
E ufitia le agaga e le taumalulu.

8
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:36,760
[musika]

9
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:38,645
O fea na lele ai le olaga e pei o se aū ua mavae aso, ua te'a

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,160
matou.

11
00:00:38,645 --> 00:00:43,080
[musika]

12
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:45,520
Sa matou faaputuina pepa, ma galo ai le mafuaaga na matou

13
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,520
tatou te ola.

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:52,200
Ma sa foliga mai i taimi uma, [musika]

15
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,200
o loʻo i ai pea le leo C i luma.

16
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,560
[musika]

17
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:58,520
Na'o le taimi na nonō mai

18
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,520
e leai se mea e avatu.

19
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:04,440
Ma faafuaseʻi ona paʻū [musika] i loʻu loto

20
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:08,960
aisa malulu.

21
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:12,200
Tatou te aʻoaʻoina e talisapaia [musika] pe a tatou faiaina,

22
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,670
pe a tape le moli a se tasi i tua o le faitotoʻa.

23
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,240
Matou te talotalo atu i tua o nofoaafi o loʻo ō ese, ma taumafai

24
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:18,320
[musika]

25
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:21,920
aioi atu i le taimi ua teʻa mo se tali.

26
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:25,000
Tatou te aʻoaʻoina le alofa pe a malulu, [musika]

27
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,360
a iai le lefulefu i ou alofilima, ae le o le uʻamea. E UIGA I AI,

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
ana faapea ou te iloa muamua, [musika]

29
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:31,840
e faapefea ona tiga le agaga o lenei tagata manino

30
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,320
fa'anoanoa.

31
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:37,840
E le'i fai mai o ia, [musika] e le'i fusi e ia, e leai sona taimi.

32
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:41,120
O se uuna'iga e fa'avavau lenei.

33
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:43,545
Sa ou teuina mea uma mo se taimi mulimuli ane, e le o isi loʻu loto

34
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,545
ua tatala. [musika]

35
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,520
O loo tatou tau ma le ata,

36
00:01:46,111 --> 00:01:50,480
[musika]

37
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:53,316
Tatou te musuā i mea faatauvaa.

38
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,880
Ma e te lē mafai ona vaʻai pe faʻapefea ona toʻa le aisa

39
00:01:53,316 --> 00:01:56,960
[musika]

40
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:59,211
i luga o o tatou tauʻau.

41
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:01,800
Ae le o iai le fiafia i le pupula o le faamalama o se faleoloa,

42
00:01:59,211 --> 00:02:05,040
[musika] e le o se faaputuga o pili, ae i se filemu

43
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:06,880
le moni o aiga, i lo latou mafanafana i le va o afa. Ae peita'i

44
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:09,920
matou te na'o le talisapaia o mea ua uma ona i ai [musika]

45
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:12,600
lē mafai ona toe foʻi.

46
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:15,760
Fa'aauau pea la'u umi

47
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:20,280
ma e masani lava o [musika] o se ala leai se uiga,

48
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:23,480
tatou te aʻoaʻoina e talisapaia pe a tatou leiloa [musika],

49
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:25,880
pe a tape le moli a se tasi i tua o le faitotoʻa.

50
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:29,520
Matou te talotalo atu i [musika] o nofoaafi ua o ese,

51
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:33,160
taumafai e aioi atu i le taimi ua tuanai mo se tali.

52
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:35,000
Tatou te aʻoaʻoina le alofa i [musika] pe a uma ona malulu,

53
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:36,160
pe a iai lefulefu i alofilima, [musika] ae leai

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,200
u'amea. E UIGA I AI,

55
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:43,040
Ana ou iloa muamua pe faapefea ona tagi i totonu

56
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:45,061
o lenei fa'anoanoa manino i le agaga.

57
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:45,480
Valaau atu i tagata matutua, fusi i latou,

58
00:02:45,061 --> 00:02:49,000
[musika]

59
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:49,000
a'o tata pea le tata o le fatu.

60
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:54,231
Tu'u ia mavae atu faitioga, o a'u o le lagolago lea i le aso

61
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,080
Ou te tatalo.

62
00:02:54,231 --> 00:02:58,280
[musika]

63
00:02:55,080 --> 00:03:00,127
Auā o pese uma e iai lona i'uga

64
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:01,320
i le iuga, tasi.

65
00:03:00,127 --> 00:03:04,680
[pese]

66
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:06,022
Matou [musika] e tumau pea i le manatuaga o mea taua,

67
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,280
ua tatou nonofo faagaloina.

68
00:03:06,022 --> 00:03:11,760
[musika]

69
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:13,720
Tatou te aʻoaʻoina le talisapaia pe a tatou faiaina,

70
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:14,959
pe a faalogoina le musika a se tasi i tua o le faitotoa

71
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:17,959
malamalama.

72
00:03:14,959 --> 00:03:20,959
Matou te talotalo atu i tua o nofoaafi o loʻo ō ese, ma taumafai

73
00:03:17,959 --> 00:03:22,360
aioi atu i le taimi ua teʻa mo se tali.

74
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:25,800
Tatou te aʻoaʻoina le alofa, [musika]

75
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:28,080
ina ua malūlū, ina ua i ai lefulefu i alofilima ma

76
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:31,160
tioata [musika] malepelepe. E tatau ona ou tausia lelei

77
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:33,532
o le ā le mea, a o tatou i ai iinei, seʻia oo i le

78
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,560
lele ese

79
00:03:33,532 --> 00:03:36,720
[musika]

80
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,720
agaga i le mea mamao.

81
00:03:40,082 --> 00:03:42,102
[musika]
